      "output": "All 73 tasks in TASKS.md are already marked complete (`[x]`) and all corresponding files have been implemented. Here's a summary of what exists:\n\n## Project Status: ✅ Complete (73/73 tasks)\n\nThe Space Tourism monorepo is fully implemented across all phases:\n\n### What's Built\n\n| Phase | Tasks | Status |\n|-------|-------|--------|\n| Phase 1: Setup (config, tooling) | T001–T016 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 2: Foundation (types, theme, constants) | T017–T027 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 3: Navbar component | T028–T031 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 4: Footer component | T032–T035 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 5: Hero component | T036–T039 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 6: Features section | T040–T046 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 7: Mission Strip | T047–T050 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 8: CTA Banner | T051–T054 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 9: Contact Form | T055–T058 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 10: Company Info Block | T059–T062 | ✅ All complete |\n| Phase 11: App Assembly | T063–T066 | ✅ All complete |\n| E2E Tests (Playwright) | T067–T070 | ✅ All complete |\n| Final Polish (a11y + bundle) | T071–T073 | ✅ All complete |\n\n### Key Deliverables\n- **Monorepo**: pnpm workspaces + Turborepo with `@space-tourism/ui` shared component library\n- **10 React components** with TypeScript, CSS Modules, and Ant Design (dark space theme)\n- **Unit tests**: Vitest + React Testing Library + `jest-axe` (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n- **E2E tests**: 4 Playwright specs covering landing, navigation, contact form, and mobile navbar\n- **Build**: Vite with manual chunk splitting (`vendor-react` / `vendor-antd`) targeting < 300 KB gzipped\n- **SPA routing**: `_redirects` file for Netlify/Vercel static hosting\n\nNo pending tasks remain — nothing to implement.",
